{"seq":1,"slug":"classifier-routing","title":"分类器路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/methods/classifier-routing","wordCount":1756,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"分类器路由\">分类器路由</h1><p>分类器路由的承诺很直接：在请求碰到任何一个大模型之前，先用一个毫秒级的小决策器读一眼请求，判断「这值不值得上强模型」，然后把请求直接送到选中的那一档。它属于谱系图里「请求前 + 学习」的格子（见 <a href=\"../foundations/routing-taxonomy\">路由方法谱系</a>），优势是只跑一次模型、几乎零额外延迟；难点是决策器必须在看不到任何答案的前提下盲判难度。RouteLLM 在 ICLR 2025 把这条路线做成了一个标准化框架，本节就以它的四类路由器为骨架，讲清楚分类器路由到底学什么、怎么学。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-学一个-该上强模型-的打分函数\">核心概念：学一个「该上强模型」的打分函数</h2><p>分类器路由的数学本体是一个打分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x) \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，输入请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，输出「这个请求需要强模型」的概率或分数。配一个阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>，决策规则就是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>路由到强模型</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{路由到强模型} \\iff s(x) \\ge \\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7073em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">路由到强模型</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>调 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 就是在 <a href=\"../foundations/cost-quality-frontier\">成本-质量前沿</a> 上滑动工作点：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 调高，更少请求上强模型，省钱但质量风险升高；调低则相反。注意这里和级联的本质区别——级联的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 算在小模型跑完之后、基于真实回答，而分类器路由的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 只能看请求文本本身。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  X[请求文本 x] --&gt; E[编码:embedding 或 token 特征]&#10;  E --&gt; S[&quot;打分函数 s(x)&lt;br/&gt;预测&#39;需要强模型&#39;的概率&quot;]&#10;  S --&gt; T{&quot;s(x) ≥ τ ?&quot;}&#10;  T --&gt;|是| L[送强模型]&#10;  T --&gt;|否| W[送小模型]&#10;  L --&gt; O[返回]&#10;  W --&gt; O\">flowchart TD\n  X[请求文本 x] --&gt; E[编码:embedding 或 token 特征]\n  E --&gt; S[\"打分函数 s(x)&lt;br/&gt;预测'需要强模型'的概率\"]\n  S --&gt; T{\"s(x) ≥ τ ?\"}\n  T --&gt;|是| L[送强模型]\n  T --&gt;|否| W[送小模型]\n  L --&gt; O[返回]\n  W --&gt; O</pre><p>整套方法的好坏，全压在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 学得准不准上，而这又取决于两件事：用什么架构、用什么数据。架构是本节主题，数据是 <a href=\"../training/routing-data\">路由数据与标注</a> 的主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四类路由器架构及其取舍\">四类路由器架构及其取舍</h2><p>RouteLLM 训练并对比了四种打分函数的实现，它们的复杂度、推理开销、效果各不相同，构成一条清晰的取舍光谱。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路由器</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>训练成本</th>\n<th>推理开销</th>\n<th>典型表现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>相似度加权（SW ranking）</td>\n<td>用请求 embedding 找历史相似样本，按它们的强弱模型胜负加权投票</td>\n<td>低（几乎免训练）</td>\n<td>中（需检索）</td>\n<td>可用，弱于学习型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>矩阵分解（MF）</td>\n<td>把「请求 × 模型」胜负建成低秩矩阵，学请求与模型的隐向量内积</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>production 综合最优之一</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BERT 分类器</td>\n<td>微调一个 BERT，直接对请求文本二分类</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中（一次小模型前向）</td>\n<td>效果好，开销略大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>因果 LLM 分类器</td>\n<td>用一个小 LLM 做分类头</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>最强但最贵，性价比常不划算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>RouteLLM 的结论是矩阵分解和 BERT 在生产上的取舍最优——前者推理几乎零开销、后者效果稍好但要一次小前向（<a href=\"https://proceedings.iclr.cc/paper_files/paper/2025/file/5503a7c69d48a2f86fc00b3dc09de686-Paper-Conference.pdf\">RouteLLM, ICLR 2025</a>）。下面单独讲透矩阵分解这一支，因为它的思路最不显然。</p>\n<h2 id=\"矩阵分解路由-把路由看成推荐问题\">矩阵分解路由：把路由看成推荐问题</h2><p>矩阵分解路由借的是推荐系统的脑子。想象一张大表，行是各种请求、列是各个模型，格子里是「这个模型在这个请求上赢没赢」。这张表绝大部分是空的（没人把每个请求都喂给每个模型跑过），但它有低秩结构——相似的请求在相似的模型上表现相近。于是用低秩分解去补全它：给每个请求学一个隐向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、每个模型学一个隐向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，预测「模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 在请求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 上的胜率」为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>σ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{r}(x, m) = \\sigma(u_x^\\top v_m)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>路由时，比较强弱两个模型的预测胜率，差距足够大就上强模型。这套做法的妙处是它天然支持多模型（多元路由）：新加一个模型只要学它的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，不用重训整个分类器。代价是请求侧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>x</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u_x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通常要靠一个 embedding 编码器现算，编码器本身的质量会卡住上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"嵌入空间里的路由直觉\">嵌入空间里的路由直觉</h2><p>无论哪种架构，分类器路由都隐含同一个几何假设：在某个嵌入空间里，「该上强模型的请求」会聚成一团、和「小模型够用的请求」分得开。如果这个假设成立，哪怕一个简单的逻辑回归都能在 embedding 上画出不错的分界面；如果不成立——比如难度和文本表面特征几乎无关——再复杂的架构也学不动。</p>\n<p>这解释了一个实践现象：在「难度能从表面线索读出来」的领域（代码请求往往比闲聊难、长文档摘要往往比短句改写难），分类器路由效果拔群；而在「表面看不出深浅」的领域（两道看起来一样的数学题难度可能差很远），它会失灵，这时往往得退回级联——让小模型先真跑一遍，用真实结果而非表面特征判断。怎么把「难度」这个信号本身做得更准，是 <a href=\"difficulty-estimation\">难度估计</a> 的全部内容；分类器路由只是难度估计的一种「请求前盲估」用法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"校准-阈值不能直接信分数\">校准：阈值不能直接信分数</h2><p>最后一个常被忽视、却直接决定线上效果的问题：分类器输出的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 往往没有校准好。一个模型可能系统性地把所有请求的分都打得偏高或偏低，导致你设的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau=0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 实际对应的强模型占比完全不是你以为的那个数。所以上线前必须做一步校准——在独立验证集上，把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 反推成「我想要的强模型占比」对应的实际分位点，而不是想当然取 0.5。这一步和级联里的置信度调优（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2502.19335v3\">Gatekeeper, 2025</a>）是同一类问题，也是 <a href=\"../practice/routing-evaluation\">路由评测</a> 要测的关键一环。跳过校准，你画出的成本-质量前沿和线上真实表现会对不上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>分类器路由学一个打分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，在请求进模型前盲估「该上强模型」的概率，配阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 决策；只跑一次、近零延迟，但无法利用任何真实答案。</li>\n<li>RouteLLM 给出四类架构：相似度加权（免训练但弱）、矩阵分解（推理近零开销、生产最优之一）、BERT（效果好略贵）、因果 LLM（最强最贵常不划算）。</li>\n<li>矩阵分解把路由当推荐问题，给请求和模型各学隐向量、用内积预测胜率，天然支持加新模型的多元路由。</li>\n<li>分类器路由隐含「难易在嵌入空间可分」的假设；表面线索能反映难度时效果好，否则需退回级联用真实结果判断。</li>\n<li>输出分数通常未校准，上线前必须把阈值反推成目标强模型占比的实际分位点，否则前沿与线上对不上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"model-cascades\">模型级联与回退</a> —— 当「请求前盲估」不可靠时的「跑过后再判」替代方案。</li>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"difficulty-estimation\">难度估计</a> —— 打分函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 背后的难度信号怎么做准。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../training/router-training\">路由器训练</a> —— 这四类架构具体怎么训、用什么损失。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分类器路由","id":"分类器路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：学一个「该上强模型」的打分函数","id":"核心概念-学一个-该上强模型-的打分函数"},{"level":2,"text":"四类路由器架构及其取舍","id":"四类路由器架构及其取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"矩阵分解路由：把路由看成推荐问题","id":"矩阵分解路由-把路由看成推荐问题"},{"level":2,"text":"嵌入空间里的路由直觉","id":"嵌入空间里的路由直觉"},{"level":2,"text":"校准：阈值不能直接信分数","id":"校准-阈值不能直接信分数"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"路由方法谱系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/foundations/routing-taxonomy"},"next":{"title":"模型级联与回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-routing-cascades/methods/model-cascades"}}